#. The landing's headline: two short sentences, each shown as its own line. Keep it short and punchy. In Brazilian Portuguese: “Pare de decidir o que estudar. Só estude.”
#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/_components/home-hero.tsx
#: src/app/[lang]/opengraph-image.tsx
msgctxt "PLtdfK"
msgid "<line>Stop deciding what to study.</line> <line>Just study.</line>"
msgstr "<line>Ne çalışacağına kafa yorma.</line> <line>Sadece çalış.</line>"

#. The landing's subhead. In Brazilian Portuguese: “Conte sua meta e a data. O Zoonk divide tudo em um plano diário do tamanho do seu tempo.”
#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/_components/home-hero.tsx
#: src/app/[lang]/opengraph-image.tsx
msgctxt "WtT1Bl"
msgid "Tell us your goal and the date. Zoonk splits it all into a daily plan sized to your time."
msgstr "Hedefini ve tarihini bize söyle. Zoonk, ayırabildiğin süreye göre çalışacaklarını gün gün planlar."

#. An example goal a learner might type, short enough to fit on one line beside a button; {month} is a month name. In Brazilian Portuguese: “virar analista de dados até {month}”.
#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/_components/landing-goal-box.tsx
msgctxt "xlsEx0"
msgid "become a data analyst by {month}"
msgstr "{month} ayına kadar veri analisti olmak"

#. An example goal a learner might type, short enough to fit on one line beside a button. Use your language's name for Mexico City.
#: src/app/[lang]/(home)/_components/landing-goal-box.tsx
msgctxt "034zMY"
msgid "speak Spanish to live in Mexico City"
msgstr "Meksiko’da yaşamak için İspanyolca konuşmak"

#. An example goal a learner might type, short enough to fit on one line beside a button. Use your language's name for London. In Brazilian Portuguese: “falar inglês para morar em Londres”.
